+==================================================
+
+Return exactly one valid JSON object using the fields below and in this order.
+
+Do not add fields.
+Do not rename fields.
+Do not add commentary outside the JSON.
+Do not use Markdown code fences around the JSON.
+
+{{
+  "content_check": "<football | not_football | player_not_found | unclear>",
